      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I agree with having the ability to select which tags to show/hide when looking for worlds/avatars, and having it set in the safety settings, so you can show/hide things you don't want to see based on tags.\nHowever, I don't think banning people for using the wrong tags is a good thing. I'd personally opt for a system where community members can add tags themselves and upvote/downvote them to have them automatically added to an avatar/world.",
