  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "For me, I extremely hate seeing some half naked egirl everywhere i go. it really ruins it for me. Instead of having to individuating blocking a few people every single time i go into a world, what if we used the tags given to select when you upload content. There could be a tab in safety that will automatically hide avatars with lewd or gorey avatars, if selected said tag. Now, if someone reports a model because the tag is incorrect, then upon reviewing the report, if considered \"bannable\" it should lock the avatar until the user reuploads it with its correct tags.  I'm sick of seeing lewd stuff so this is my idea of fixing this issue. And I'm sure others would enjoy this feature (seeing a post talking about it right now as im typing)",
